abstract: >
  NEUSARS v3.3.2 is a consolidated sovereign software bundle implementing a
  deterministic computational nodal system within the D10Z framework. The
  release provides a technical execution artifact with frozen inputs,
  canonical outputs, digest sealing, Ed25519 signing, fail-closed validation,
  independent replay, and pack-level sealing. The bundle is designed as a
  reproducible and auditable software system for sovereign-grade technical
  review, rather than as an abstract mathematical disclosure.
